   posterior >= 0.10) remains unresolved.

2. actionable_parent:
   Multiple child branches remain unresolved but they ALL share a single immediate
   management path; finer diagnosis would not change the next action.
   Sub-type: actionable_parent_syndrome — when a known parent-level diagnosis
   (e.g., "infected biliary obstruction") already determines management regardless
